{"vid":"xsKkLUjujsg","source":"xsKkLUjujsg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":4.7,"txt":"My name's Kyle. I'm a sandwich maker"},{"t":6.6,"txt":"here at Kingston Bread and Bar in"},{"t":8,"txt":"Kingston, New York. And here's 10 things"},{"t":10.1,"txt":"I wish I knew about being a sandwich"},{"t":11.6,"txt":"maker before I started."},{"t":17,"txt":"Today I'm going to be taking you through"},{"t":18.3,"txt":"what it looks like to make one of our"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"favorite sandwiches here, uh, the"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"Hashish. This is a customer favorite."},{"t":26,"txt":"I come in, we receive bread delivery,"},{"t":28.4,"txt":"um, prepping first thing in the morning,"},{"t":30.5,"txt":"um, hoping to make it with everything"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"that we need before our guests come in."},{"t":34.8,"txt":"There's usually a rush right at the"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"beginning."},{"t":39,"txt":"The Hashish has an egg on it. It takes"},{"t":41.1,"txt":"the longest to cook out of everything"},{"t":42.5,"txt":"that's on the sandwich."},{"t":46.2,"txt":"I'm here first thing in the morning. I'm"},{"t":49,"txt":"up by 6:30 to try to be here as soon as"},{"t":53,"txt":"I can be."},{"t":54.6,"txt":"50 hours is on the low end of what"},{"t":57,"txt":"you're doing, and I've worked as many as"},{"t":59.8,"txt":"70 hours."},{"t":62.4,"txt":"One thing I wish I had known about"},{"t":64.1,"txt":"getting into this line of work is that"},{"t":65.4,"txt":"you don't have to go to school."},{"t":67.2,"txt":"Everybody when you start out tells you"},{"t":68.5,"txt":"to go to a school for culinary, and"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"that's totally not the way that it has"},{"t":72.3,"txt":"to be. I learned from mentors and just"},{"t":76.6,"txt":"kind of getting getting kicked around a"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"lot. So,"},{"t":80.4,"txt":"once the egg goes down,"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"I usually put the latke down. It takes"},{"t":84.4,"txt":"about 2 minutes."},{"t":86,"txt":"And once the latke goes down, the corned"},{"t":88.7,"txt":"beef goes down as well."},{"t":93.2,"txt":"Staging is a French term, um, from the"},{"t":96.2,"txt":"brigade kitchen system that essentially"},{"t":98.6,"txt":"denotes, uh, working interview. So, your"},{"t":100.9,"txt":"very first time in this kitchen will be"},{"t":102.8,"txt":"you prepping food. Will be you following"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"a prep list. It's very hands-on and, uh,"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"very very direct in the way that they"},{"t":109.5,"txt":"operate. Three hard skills that are"},{"t":111.4,"txt":"essential: knife skills, cooking skills,"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"and, uh, taste profile. You have to be"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"on time, early even. Early is late in a"},{"t":118.9,"txt":"lot of places that I've worked. Uh you"},{"t":121.3,"txt":"have to be clean, tidy, shaven. Knives"},{"t":124.8,"txt":"have to be sharp. Cutting a a bun in"},{"t":126.8,"txt":"half 100 times a day is not easy when"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"you're trying to do every single one"},{"t":131.3,"txt":"exactly in half. There's a little bit of"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"spicy mustard that we make in-house that"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"goes on the bun after it's been toasted."},{"t":138.3,"txt":"As well as a little bit of onion."},{"t":141.9,"txt":"Red onion."},{"t":145,"txt":"I wish I had known sooner"},{"t":147.2,"txt":"uh about"},{"t":148.8,"txt":"the professionalism of of what comes"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"within the industry. I'm lucky enough"},{"t":154.4,"txt":"that my bosses are cool here that when I"},{"t":156.9,"txt":"wore a Dolly Parton t-shirt to my"},{"t":158.3,"txt":"interview, they're like, \"This guy's"},{"t":159.4,"txt":"cool.\" But definitely not going to be"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"everybody. When it comes to salary and"},{"t":164.4,"txt":"job roles uh such as mine or even"},{"t":167.4,"txt":"expanded more"},{"t":169.4,"txt":"um involved roles, maybe such as being a"},{"t":173.2,"txt":"sous chef or one of the less"},{"t":175.1,"txt":"intermediate positions higher up, um"},{"t":177.9,"txt":"there's sort of this notion that you'll"},{"t":181.2,"txt":"be getting paid more. Some of the common"},{"t":183.4,"txt":"trajectories for an intermediate job"},{"t":185.2,"txt":"role like mine, it's not quite at the"},{"t":187.8,"txt":"beginning level, but it would start"},{"t":189.6,"txt":"typically as a prep, you move to a"},{"t":191.4,"txt":"sandwich production. You could expand in"},{"t":194.2,"txt":"this specific role to managing our bread"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"program, which is an even greater, more"},{"t":198.1,"txt":"important role that we have."},{"t":202.5,"txt":"If you're somebody who likes your"},{"t":203.4,"txt":"holidays off, you might not get that."},{"t":206.7,"txt":"There's almost a guarantee that you'll"},{"t":208.4,"txt":"be working in"},{"t":210.6,"txt":"uh Christmas. You'll be working on"},{"t":211.9,"txt":"Thanksgiving. One of the things I really"},{"t":213.6,"txt":"love about working in kitchens are the"},{"t":215.8,"txt":"different types of people that you meet."},{"t":217.1,"txt":"There's really no end to the person that"},{"t":219.6,"txt":"you're standing next to shoulder"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"shoulder with. I love community. It's"},{"t":224.4,"txt":"why I work so much. I don't have very"},{"t":227.2,"txt":"many people in my family, and this is"},{"t":228.9,"txt":"how I I stay active socially as well."},{"t":231.5,"txt":"There's a big aspect to it of being"},{"t":233.8,"txt":"around people that you love all the"},{"t":234.9,"txt":"time."},{"t":236.7,"txt":"I'm really hoping to eventually get into"},{"t":241.2,"txt":"my own space."},{"t":243.1,"txt":"Uh, I don't know in what capacity this"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"will be, but I do know that I have a"},{"t":248.3,"txt":"large passion for"},{"t":251.7,"txt":"bringing people together."},{"t":253.5,"txt":"Um, this is a small town and there's a"},{"t":255.9,"txt":"lot of things that are happening in a"},{"t":258.2,"txt":"together kind of way."},{"t":260.1,"txt":"You'll always see people you know,"},{"t":262.3,"txt":"always have people popping in that you"},{"t":264.1,"txt":"don't know."},{"t":268.2,"txt":"Thanks for watching. Subscribe to the"},{"t":269.8,"txt":"channel and search Indeed for more."}],"words":[{"t":4.68,"w":"My"},{"t":4.8,"w":"name's"},{"t":5.04,"w":"Kyle."},{"t":5.68,"w":"I'm"},{"t":5.96,"w":"a"},{"t":6.04,"w":"sandwich"},{"t":6.36,"w":"maker"},{"t":6.6,"w":"here"},{"t":6.8,"w":"at"},{"t":6.88,"w":"Kingston"},{"t":7.2,"w":"Bread"},{"t":7.36,"w":"and"},{"t":7.48,"w":"Bar"},{"t":7.84,"w":"in"},{"t":8.04,"w":"Kingston,"},{"t":8.4,"w":"New"},{"t":8.52,"w":"York."},{"t":9.24,"w":"And"},{"t":9.48,"w":"here's"},{"t":9.72,"w":"10"},{"t":9.88,"w":"things"},{"t":10.12,"w":"I"},{"t":10.2,"w":"wish"},{"t":10.44,"w":"I"},{"t":10.52,"w":"knew"},{"t":10.76,"w":"about"},{"t":11.12,"w":"being"},{"t":11.28,"w":"a"},{"t":11.32,"w":"sandwich"},{"t":11.64,"w":"maker"},{"t":11.92,"w":"before"},{"t":12.2,"w":"I"},{"t":12.24,"w":"started."},{"t":17.04,"w":"Today"},{"t":17.24,"w":"I'm"},{"t":17.32,"w":"going"},{"t":17.44,"w":"to"},{"t":17.48,"w":"be"},{"t":17.72,"w":"taking"},{"t":18.04,"w":"you"},{"t":18.16,"w":"through"},{"t":18.32,"w":"what"},{"t":18.4,"w":"it"},{"t":18.48,"w":"looks"},{"t":18.64,"w":"like"},{"t":18.88,"w":"to"},{"t":19,"w":"make"},{"t":19.12,"w":"one"},{"t":19.24,"w":"of"},{"t":19.32,"w":"our"},{"t":19.44,"w":"favorite"},{"t":19.68,"w":"sandwiches"},{"t":20.16,"w":"here,"},{"t":20.72,"w":"uh,"},{"t":20.8,"w":"the"},{"t":20.92,"w":"Hashish."},{"t":21.36,"w":"This"},{"t":21.56,"w":"is"},{"t":21.68,"w":"a"},{"t":21.76,"w":"customer"},{"t":22.12,"w":"favorite."},{"t":26,"w":"I"},{"t":26.08,"w":"come"},{"t":26.32,"w":"in,"},{"t":26.56,"w":"we"},{"t":26.68,"w":"receive"},{"t":27.04,"w":"bread"},{"t":27.24,"w":"delivery,"},{"t":28.36,"w":"um,"},{"t":28.56,"w":"prepping"},{"t":29.12,"w":"first"},{"t":29.4,"w":"thing"},{"t":29.56,"w":"in"},{"t":29.64,"w":"the"},{"t":29.72,"w":"morning,"},{"t":30.48,"w":"um,"},{"t":30.96,"w":"hoping"},{"t":31.28,"w":"to"},{"t":31.4